00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:09.310
The radiance I felt was recorded as data by the sensors as well.

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:13.820
This is my personal opinion, but it might be communication.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:15.470
Good work.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:18.590
Both of you go back to your rooms and rest.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:20.120
Excuse us.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:29.320
Well... this is problematic.

